@@ -20,0 +21,9 @@
+`element.label_provenance` attributes direct text to its element and nested
+text to the nearest interactive control. A layout parent does not inherit its
+children's labels. `match_evidence` separates label terms, attribute terms,
+and a complete label phrase in the query. Inspect `decision.selection_policy`,
+`top_score_tie_count`, all `candidates`, and `omitted_candidate_count`: a
+unique top score ranks source declarations, while lower-scoring controls may
+still be relevant. Short query words distinguish labels such as “Sign in” and
+“Sign up”; standalone short matches in attributes do not identify a control.
+
